  </div></header>
  <main>
    <section class="wrap hero" id="home">
      <div><div class="eyebrow"><i class="spark"></i> Your Geometry Dash community hub</div><h1>Play hard.<br><span class="gradient">Track everything.</span></h1><p>Discover challenging demons, see how players stack up, check your progress, and estimate your demon points—all in one place built for the Geometry Dash community.</p><div class="actions"><a class="btn primary" href="#demons">Explore demon lists <span>→</span></a><a class="btn secondary" href="#stat-checker">Check your stats</a></div></div>
      <div class="hero-art" aria-hidden="true"><div class="orbit"></div><div class="cube">▧</div><div class="float-card fc-top"><small>COMMUNITY RANK</small><strong>#01 <span style="color:var(--yellow)">✦</span></strong></div><div class="float-card fc-bottom"><small><span class="live">●</span> THE GRIND IS ON</small><strong>One more attempt.</strong></div></div>
    </section>
    <section class="wrap section" aria-label="Community at a glance"><div class="stats-grid">
      <div class="stat-card"><div class="stat-label">Demon categories</div><div class="stat-number">03</div><div class="stat-foot">Impossible · Main · Upcoming</div></div>
      <div class="stat-card"><div class="stat-label">Player leaderboard</div><div class="stat-number">Live-ish</div><div class="stat-foot">Community-style rankings</div></div>
      <div class="stat-card"><div class="stat-label">Tools for players</div><div class="stat-number">02</div><div class="stat-foot">Stats + demon points</div></div>
      <div class="stat-card"><div class="stat-label">Made for the community</div><div class="stat-number">∞</div><div class="stat-foot">Keep pushing your limits</div></div>
    </div></section>
    <section class="wrap section" id="about"><div class="section-head"><div><div class="kicker">Everything in one place</div><h2>What is GeometryStats?</h2><p class="section-desc">A fan-made hub for the people who love Geometry Dash: browse community demon lists, compare player stats, and get quick point estimates.</p></div></div>
      <div class="feature-grid">
        <a class="feature-card" href="#demons"><div class="feature-icon">⚡</div><h3>Find your next challenge</h3><p>Browse separate lists for main, upcoming, and impossible demons. Search levels by name or creator.</p><span class="text-link">Browse demon lists →</span></a>
        <a class="feature-card" href="#leaderboard"><div class="feature-icon" style="background:#a98bff1c">🏆</div><h3>See the top players</h3><p>Check out a sample community leaderboard, organized by player points and completions.</p><span class="text-link">View leaderboard →</span></a>
        <a class="feature-card" href="#calculator"><div class="feature-icon" style="background:#ff70bd1a">📈</div><h3>Make sense of your progress</h3><p>Enter your stats for a quick profile estimate, or calculate a rough point value for a demon run.</p><span class="text-link">Try the tools →</span></a>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section class="wrap section" id="demons"><div class="section-head"><div><div class="kicker">Pick a challenge</div><h2>Community demon lists</h2><p class="section-desc">Explore different kinds of community-curated challenges. These example entries are for demonstration.</p></div><span class="text-link">Sorted by community placement ↗</span></div>
      <div class="panel"><div class="tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="Demon categories"><button class="tab selected" data-category="main" role="tab" aria-selected="true">Main list</button><button class="tab" data-category="upcoming" role="tab" aria-selected="false">Upcoming</button><button class="tab" data-category="impossible" role="tab" aria-selected="false">Impossible</button></div>
        <div class="list-tools"><div id="listCaption" class="stat-label">Ranked community challenges</div><input class="search" id="demonSearch" type="search" placeholder="Search levels or creators…" aria-label="Search demons"></div>
        <div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>Rank</th><th>Level</th><th>Creator</th><th>Category</th><th>Points*</th></tr></thead><tbody id="demonRows"></tbody></table><div class="empty" id="demonEmpty" hidden>No matching levels. Try another search.</div></div>
        <div class="note">*Example data for the site preview. A live, community-maintained list would need a data source and moderation.</div>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section class="wrap section" id="leaderboard"><div class="section-head"><div><div class="kicker">Chase the next milestone</div><h2>Player leaderboard</h2><p class="section-desc">A sample showcase of how player rankings could look. Scores shown here are illustrative, not official.</p></div><span class="text-link">Updated by the community ↗</span></div>
      <div class="panel"><div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>Rank</th><th>Player</th><th>Points</th><th>Demons beaten</th><th>Top demon</th></tr></thead><tbody id="leaderRows"></tbody></table></div><div class="note">Leaderboard entries are sample content only; GeometryStats is not connected to Geometry Dash accounts or official servers.</div></div>
    </section>
    <section class="wrap section" id="stat-checker"><div class="section-head"><div><div class="kicker">Your progress, at a glance</div><h2>Player stat checker</h2><p class="section-desc">Enter your numbers to get a quick profile summary. Results are calculated in your browser and are not an official account lookup.</p></div></div>
      <div class="tools-grid"><div class="panel"><div class="tool-title"><div class="feature-icon">🔎</div><h3>Check your stats</h3></div><p class="tool-sub">Add your in-game counts to create a simple progress snapshot.</p><form id="statsForm"><div class="form-grid"><div class="field full"><label for="playerName">Player name</label><input id="playerName" maxlength="24" placeholder="e.g. DashPlayer" required></div><div class="field"><label for="stars">Stars</label><input id="stars" type="number" min="0" value="0" required></div><div class="field"><label for="demons">Demons beaten</label><input id="demons" type="number" min="0" value="0" required></div><div class="field"><label for="coins">User coins</label><input id="coins" type="number" min="0" value="0" required></div><div class="field"><label for="creatorPoints">Creator points</label><input id="creatorPoints" type="number" min="0" value="0" required></div></div><button class="form-btn" type="submit">Build my snapshot</button></form><div class="result" id="statsResult" aria-live="polite"></div></div>
        <div class="panel"><div class="tool-title"><div class="feature-icon" style="background:#ffd66b1b">📊</div><h3>What is this?</h3></div><p class="tool-sub">The stat checker helps you put your progress in one place.</p><div class="stat-card" style="margin-bottom:11px"><div class="stat-label">Your details stay yours</div><div style="font-weight:800;margin-top:5px">No login. No account connection.</div><div class="note">This preview only calculates a summary from the values you enter. It does not retrieve player records from Geometry Dash.</div></div><div class="stat-card"><div class="stat-label">Want a real player lookup?</div><div style="font-weight:800;margin-top:5px">Connect an approved data source</div><div class="note">A production version would require a reliable API, clear data attribution, and permission to use player data.</div></div></div>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section class="wrap section" id="calculator"><div class="section-head"><div><div class="kicker">Plan your next victory</div><h2>Demon point calculator</h2><p class="section-desc">Estimate points from a demon's list placement and your progress percentage. This simple preview uses an illustrative formula.</p></div></div>
      <div class="tools-grid"><div class="panel"><div class="tool-title"><div class="feature-icon" style="background:#ffd66b1b">🧮</div><h3>Estimate a run</h3></div><p class="tool-sub">Select a category, enter placement and progress, then calculate.</p><form id="calcForm"><div class="form-grid"><div class="field"><label for="calcCategory">Demon category</label><select id="calcCategory"><option value="main">Main list</option><option value="upcoming">Upcoming</option><option value="impossible">Impossible</option></select></div><div class="field"><label for="placement">List placement</label><input id="placement" type="number" min="1" value="1" required></div><div class="field full"><label for="progress">Progress (%)</label><input id="progress" type="number" min="0" max="100" value="100" required></div></div><button class="form-btn" type="submit">Calculate estimate</button></form><div class="result" id="calcResult" aria-live="polite"></div></div>
        <div class="panel"><div class="tool-title"><div class="feature-icon" style="background:#a98bff1c">💡</div><h3>How the estimate works</h3></div><p class="tool-sub">A clear example formula—not an official Geometry Dash or list score.</p><div class="stat-card"><div class="stat-label">Preview formula</div><div style="font-weight:800;margin-top:6px">Base value × progress factor</div><div class="note">Base value is determined by the selected category and placement. Progress factor scales from 0 to 1 based on the percentage entered.</div></div><p class="note">Different community lists use different scoring rules. Replace this sample calculation with the rules of your chosen list before publishing official-looking scores.</p></div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
  <footer class="footer"><div class="wrap footer-inner"><div><b>GeometryStats</b> · Made for the Geometry Dash community.</div><div class="disclaimer">Fan-made community project; not affiliated with RobTop Games or Geometry Dash. Sample lists, rankings, and point estimates are illustrative.</div></div></footer>
